<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA FINAL DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA FINAL DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fifth and final day of the fourth cricket test between West Indies and India on Tuesday:</p>
